Package: ooalias
Version: 0.2.0-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: openOODA-tools <ops@openooda.org>
Description: Command macro and alias resolver with scope isolation
 A sovereign command macro and alias resolver written in pure openOODA, featuring
 zero ambient authority, cycle detection, oote color themes, and an MCP stdio server.
